stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Available
  Available --> Borrowed : Checkout
  Available --> Reserved : Hold assigned for Ready reservation
  Available --> Damaged : Mark damaged
  Available --> Lost : Mark lost
  Borrowed --> Available : Return (no Pending reservation)
  Borrowed --> Reserved : Return (assign to oldest Pending reservation -> Ready)
  Reserved --> Borrowed : Fulfill pickup within 72h
  Reserved --> Available : Cancel or expire 72h (no next Pending reservation)
  Reserved --> Reserved : Cancel or expire 72h (reassign next Pending -> Ready)